# R21 reveler conversations for the flag costume: logic from tools/content/build_fools_day_dialogue.py, lines drafted by Gemini (R21 revelers), edited.

~ wendel_somerton_start
wendel_somerton [smile]: By official proclamation of the Mayor's office, you are hereby ordered to make merry! Wave a banner, take a pie, and observe the proper festival regulations with a smile!
-> wendel_somerton_menu

~ wendel_somerton_menu
* [if flag.release_slips >= 1] Show them a release slip -> wendel_somerton_slip
* [Persuasion DC 15] Invite them to a better party, at a quiet church -> wendel_somerton_church | wendel_somerton_church_fail
* [Deception DC 15] Say Chuckles wants them at the church for the next number -> wendel_somerton_church | wendel_somerton_church_fail
* [knows:calm_emotions] Cast Calm Emotions on them -> wendel_somerton_calm
* [knows:greater_restoration] Cast Greater Restoration on them -> wendel_somerton_calm
* Knock them out of the costume, bruised but not hurt for good -> wendel_somerton_fight
* Leave them dancing for now -> END

~ wendel_somerton_slip
wendel_somerton [neutral]: Good heavens, my waistcoat is ruined and I have lost my hat! None of these booths have filed a single permit with my office, it is utter anarchy!
set release_slips -= 1
set reveler_wendel_somerton = "tickets"
set reveler_wendel_somerton_freed
set revelers_freed += 1
-> END

~ wendel_somerton_church
wendel_somerton [smile]: A VIP reception at the church, properly sanctioned and awaiting my inspection? Well, as Mayor, it is my civic duty to lead the procession there at once!
lead wendel_somerton to fd_silent_church
if check.last
set reveler_wendel_somerton = "church"
set reveler_wendel_somerton_freed
set revelers_freed += 1
set church_guests += 1
endif
-> END

~ wendel_somerton_church_fail
wendel_somerton [smile]: Leave the Founder's Round in the middle of the grand municipal parade? Unthinkable, my dear friends, the Mayor must remain where the banners fly highest!
set fd_chuckles_amused
-> wendel_somerton_menu

~ wendel_somerton_calm
wendel_somerton [weary]: My word, my calves are cramping something dreadful and my cane is sticky with jam. Someone must inform Mr. Druskenvald that this carnival lacks any lawful charter!
set reveler_wendel_somerton = "uncharmed"
set reveler_wendel_somerton_freed
set revelers_freed += 1
-> END

~ wendel_somerton_fight
wendel_somerton [angry]: Any interference with the festivities is strictly prohibited by order of the Lord of Fools! Stand aside and wave your flags, or I shall enforce the merriment myself!
Narrator: The dancers nearby keep on dancing. Nobody here is going to remember a punch.
combat reveler_wendel_somerton

~ wendel_somerton_beaten
wendel_somerton [weary]: Assaulting the Mayor in the middle of the thoroughfare is a grave infraction! Still, seeing as you knocked that infernal jester's tune out of my ears, I shall waive the fine.
set reveler_wendel_somerton = "beaten"
set reveler_wendel_somerton_freed
set revelers_freed += 1
-> END

~ wendel_somerton_sheltered
wendel_somerton [weary]: Not a single ledger survived in my office, just rafters crammed with steaming mutton pies. How am I to govern Wickermoor when the streets themselves will not sit still?
-> END

~ alda_farnum_start
alda_farnum [smile]: Welcome back, my darlings, the drinks are on the house and the flags are flying free! Forget the tab, step lively, and dance a measure with your favourite hostess!
-> alda_farnum_menu

~ alda_farnum_menu
* [if flag.release_slips >= 1] Show them a release slip -> alda_farnum_slip
* [Persuasion DC 15] Invite them to a better party, at a quiet church -> alda_farnum_church | alda_farnum_church_fail
* [Deception DC 15] Say Chuckles wants them at the church for the next number -> alda_farnum_church | alda_farnum_church_fail
* [knows:calm_emotions] Cast Calm Emotions on them -> alda_farnum_calm
* [knows:greater_restoration] Cast Greater Restoration on them -> alda_farnum_calm
* Knock them out of the costume, bruised but not hurt for good -> alda_farnum_fight
* Leave them dancing for now -> END

~ alda_farnum_slip
alda_farnum [neutral]: Giving away free pies and dancing in the dirt without charging a copper, how utterly mortifying. Help me out of this gaudy rag before someone sees me like this.
set release_slips -= 1
set reveler_alda_farnum = "tickets"
set reveler_alda_farnum_freed
set revelers_freed += 1
-> END

~ alda_farnum_church
alda_farnum [smile]: An exclusive gathering up at the church with a finer class of guest? Now that sounds like a profitable room to work, my dears, show me the way!
lead alda_farnum to fd_silent_church
if check.last
set reveler_alda_farnum = "church"
set reveler_alda_farnum_freed
set revelers_freed += 1
set church_guests += 1
endif
-> END

~ alda_farnum_church_fail
alda_farnum [smile]: Close up shop here when the whole square is buying what we are selling? Never in your life, sweethearts, the best crowd is right under these ribbons!
set fd_chuckles_amused
-> alda_farnum_menu

~ alda_farnum_calm
alda_farnum [weary]: My throat is raw from singing, and I never sing without a gold piece on the table first. Whatever that squeaking creature is, he owes me dearly for my inn.
set reveler_alda_farnum = "uncharmed"
set reveler_alda_farnum_freed
set revelers_freed += 1
-> END

~ alda_farnum_fight
alda_farnum [angry]: We do not allow rough customers to spoil the atmosphere at this party, my dears! Smile and pay your respects to the banner, or we will settle your tab right here!
Narrator: The dancers nearby keep on dancing. Nobody here is going to remember a punch.
combat reveler_alda_farnum

~ alda_farnum_beaten
alda_farnum [weary]: You could have mussed the costume without bruising the innkeeper, darling, though I suppose we can call our accounts even. That jester had me smiling until my cheeks bled.
set reveler_alda_farnum = "beaten"
set reveler_alda_farnum_freed
set revelers_freed += 1
-> END

~ alda_farnum_sheltered
alda_farnum [weary]: He stuffed the Green Queen Inn from cellar to chimney with pastry, right over my best linen and my private books. Someone is going to pay that bill in blood.
-> END

~ jean_myriel_start
jean_myriel [smile]: Drop your steel and grab a ribbon, friends, the bellows are pumping a merry tune tonight! Wave the banner high and let the anvils ring for the festival!
-> jean_myriel_menu

~ jean_myriel_menu
* [if flag.release_slips >= 1] Show them a release slip -> jean_myriel_slip
* [Persuasion DC 15] Invite them to a better party, at a quiet church -> jean_myriel_church | jean_myriel_church_fail
* [Deception DC 15] Say Chuckles wants them at the church for the next number -> jean_myriel_church | jean_myriel_church_fail
* [knows:calm_emotions] Cast Calm Emotions on them -> jean_myriel_calm
* [knows:greater_restoration] Cast Greater Restoration on them -> jean_myriel_calm
* Knock them out of the costume, bruised but not hurt for good -> jean_myriel_fight
* Leave them dancing for now -> END

~ jean_myriel_slip
jean_myriel [neutral]: Well, that was uglier than a cracked horseshoe. A grown smith waving a silk rag on a pole is a sight you had better forget by morning.
set release_slips -= 1
set reveler_jean_myriel = "tickets"
set reveler_jean_myriel_freed
set revelers_freed += 1
-> END

~ jean_myriel_church
jean_myriel [smile]: You say they have finer bells and heavier ironwork ringing up at the old church? Come on then, let us march up the hill and hear how they strike!
lead jean_myriel to fd_silent_church
if check.last
set reveler_jean_myriel = "church"
set reveler_jean_myriel_freed
set revelers_freed += 1
set church_guests += 1
endif
-> END

~ jean_myriel_church_fail
jean_myriel [smile]: Leave the fire while the iron is red hot and the drums are beating? Not a chance, friends, grab a pie and swing your boots with me!
set fd_chuckles_amused
-> jean_myriel_menu

~ jean_myriel_calm
jean_myriel [weary]: My ears are ringing worse than a day with the heavy sledge. That little painted devil turned my whole smithy into a pie stall while I grinned like an idiot.
set reveler_jean_myriel = "uncharmed"
set reveler_jean_myriel_freed
set revelers_freed += 1
-> END

~ jean_myriel_fight
jean_myriel [angry]: Do not go throwing cold water on our forge, friends, the festival is just heating up! Dance along nicely now, or I will hammer some cheer right into your skulls!
Narrator: The dancers nearby keep on dancing. Nobody here is going to remember a punch.
combat reveler_jean_myriel

~ jean_myriel_beaten
jean_myriel [weary]: You swing a fair hammer, friend, right on the temper line. Hurts like the devil, mind you, but it beat capering round the square in silk breeches.
set reveler_jean_myriel = "beaten"
set reveler_jean_myriel_freed
set revelers_freed += 1
-> END

~ jean_myriel_sheltered
jean_myriel [weary]: It is good to sit on cold stone where nothing is jingling or grinning at you. When my hands stop twitching, I have a score to settle with a hammer.
-> END

